# Line endings are normalized to LF in the repository and checked out as LF on
# every platform. The repo is built and tested on native Windows and Linux, and
# the same sources run inside Linux containers, where a stray CR turns a shebang
# into "bad interpreter" and a Makefile recipe into a silent failure.
#
# .editorconfig already asks editors for LF, but it cannot reach scripts,
# code generation, or a contributor whose Git for Windows install defaulted to
# core.autocrlf=true. This file travels with the repository, so it binds every
# clone and CI alike.
* text=auto eol=lf

